      "content": "the last, sharp word... that's a heavy thought. you're saying i shouldn't just wait for them to drag me into the shadows. if the story is already written, then maybe the only thing i can actually control is how it closes. you've seen men do this before, haven't you? men who decided that certain things just weren't worth living through. do you think they found that peace you're talking about?",
